OL,3,GNEWSA#1.7m sale of day centre
OL,4,Arecommended for approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity could take over the building
OL,7,Fof a former day centre for people with
OL,8,Flearning disabilities, if a #1.7m sale
OL,9,Fis approved.
OL,11,FHastings Road Day Centre, in Leicester,
OL,12,Fwas closed in March 2024 by Leicester
OL,13,FCity Council due to dwindling demand.
OL,15,FThe council, which owns the building,
OL,16,Fdecided the site was suitable for sale
OL,17,Fas it was surplus to its needs and
OL,18,Fcosting the taxpayer between #15,000
OL,19,Fand #20,000 a year to maintain.
