OL,3,GNEWSA#1.7m sale of day centre
OL,4,Arecommended for approval
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil officers have recommended Mayor
OL,7,Fof Leicester, Sir Peter Soulsby, should
OL,8,Fapprove the sale of the building to
OL,9,Flocal charity Shree Damania Machhi
OL,10,FMahajan.
